WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.590
You have a thought worth sharing.

00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:05.950
And no time to write it.

00:00:08.350 --> 00:00:13.070
So say it out loud. Press record, and talk for two minutes.

00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:23.470
Agents find the point. The message in three lines, the idea on one screen, and the whole road for anyone who wants it.

00:00:24.350 --> 00:00:33.710
Each agent has one job. Versions, drawings, sources. And two that can stop a post, in writing.

00:00:34.350 --> 00:00:40.430
Every change carries its reason, and every version links back to what you actually said.

00:00:40.850 --> 00:00:44.690
Then it comes back to you. Nothing goes live until you merge it.

00:00:46.350 --> 00:00:49.950
Talked out loud. Tidied by AI.
